<title>FRANCE: France, Italy defence ministers to meet in Bosnia.</title>
<headline>France, Italy defence ministers to meet in Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Defence Minister Beniamino Andreatta said after talks with his French counterpart Charles Millon on Paris that the two had agreed to meet again in Bosnia on December 24.</p>
<p>Both men will be in Bosnia on Christmas Eve visiting respective national troop contingents serving with the IFOR international peace force under French command in southwest Bosnia, Andreatta said.</p>
</text>
